# Ambulatory Reactor: "Artifact creatures you control have "{T}: Add {C}. Spend this mana only to cast an artifact spell
# or activate an ability of an artifact source."" (CR 613.1f, layer 6; CR 605.1a.) Turn 3: the Reactor itself and
# Bot1's Ornithopter each tap for {C}, so the pool is exactly {C}{C}; Bot1's Kobolds of Kher Keep is a creature but not
# an artifact, and Bot2's own Ornithopter (cast on turn 2, so not summoning sick by turn 4) is not one Bot1 controls:
# neither has the ability. Bot1's Tormod's Crypt is an artifact but not a creature, so it cannot tap for mana either.
# Naming "Add {C}" in that refusal distinguishes the granted mana ability from the Crypt's printed ability.

